# Never commit issued certificates, private keys, or the ACME account material.
# In this stack they live in the `letsencrypt` NAMED VOLUME, not on disk here,
# so nothing should ever appear — but if you switch to a bind mount, these keep
# a private key out of git even so (requirement 12).
letsencrypt/
certbot/
*.pem
*.key
privkey*.pem
fullchain*.pem
# Runtime secrets for the app.
.env
